note Layout put: the index is past the array field and the value would overflow (uchar add past 255). omc
note decides which trap fires first; the gate requires ng to give the same exit. Exit is the trap.
om2
layout lo 8
field a uchar 4 at 0 little
end
fn maxb to uchar
ret 255
end
fn five to ulong
ret 4
end
fn setit c edit lo to void
put c a five add maxb 1
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 8 0
setit c
ret 0
end
